        "Content": "•\tDetached family residence extending to approx. 199m2 / c. 2,140 square feet\r\n\r\n•\tBER B3 energy rating \r\n\r\n•\tFive spacious bedrooms, including principal en-suite\r\n \r\n•\tThree generous reception rooms with excellent entertaining space \r\n\r\n•\tLarge kitchen/breakfast room and separate utility \r\n\r\n•\tBeautifully landscaped, private gardens surrounding the property \r\n\r\n•\tExtensive cobblelock driveway with ample off-street parking \r\n\r\n•\tPrestigious Mariners Cove location within minutes of Howth Village, DART station, harbour, schools and coastal amenities."
